  "content": "\n\n<p>受《泰拉瑞亚》启发，添加了血月、火把神、史莱姆雨等众多有趣的事件</p>\n<p>后续还将继续添加泰拉瑞亚中的全部事件</p>\n<p>已完成的事件</p>\n<ul>\n<li>血月</li>\n<li>火把神</li>\n<li>史莱姆雨</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/mDCqeboS/images/8ee09d58e7207ccc44f2a9c0b31c1283f4a61fdb_350.webp\" alt=\"alt text\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/mDCqeboS/images/84289d81a49e1b8ea5d24cfb3a113ee1d7639ced_350.webp\" alt=\"alt text\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/mDCqeboS/images/1c614fb93223eb7d638d164badf08639ddc749fa_350.webp\" alt=\"alt text\"></p>",
